msgid "``64``"
msgstr "``64``"

#: ../../operations.rst:55
msgid ""
"Connections one socket peer address may hold, 0 (no bound) to 8192; an "
"IPv6 peer counts with its ``--ipv6-prefix`` network, and forwarded "
"headers play no part; further ones are answered ``503``"
msgstr ""
"Verbindungen, die eine Peer-Adresse eines Sockets halten darf, 0 (keine "
"Grenze) bis 8192; ein IPv6-Peer zählt mit seinem ``--ipv6-prefix``-Netz, "
